cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MetaFuncDecoder, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: MetaFuncDecoder
abstract: >
  User-friendly functional annotation interpretation for annotated metagenomes.
  Maps KO terms, Pfam IDs, and CAZy family assignments to functional categories
  with cross-database evidence counts.
authors:
